  "$comment": "The wire lock (tools/wire-lock.ts): hashes of every frozen wire entry, published test vector, constant, normative wire section of the specification and binding document, with the specification's version and, within a draft, its marker. tools/wire-lock.wire.test.ts fails on any difference and names its kind; only the CI role may accept one, with `pnpm run wire:lock -- --accept <incompatible|addition|specification>`, which checks that the version, or within a draft the marker, moved accordingly. Never edit by hand.",
